7,Kaalamaya - Goldfields Aboriginal Language Centre,https://wangka.com.au/languages/Kaalamaya/,"Thus, he treats them as distinct languages. Similarly, David Nash's comparison of Adam's word list 'Natingero tribe' in Curr to a word list of Kalaamaya gathered by Tindale shows only 36% words in common.' Kaalamaya Migration Currently, Kaalamaya people are located in Kalgoorlie and South Australia.",Kalaamaya,Australian
